#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:426
msgid ""
"The filter in area <emphasis role=\"bold\">F</emphasis> can be changed by "
"clicking on the area to open the drop down list and then selecting the "
"filter named \"All files\". This filter applies no rules, essentially "
"disabling any filtering operation, and lists all the files in the currently "
"selected folder. Note, however, as explained in the warning given in the "
"section explaining area <emphasis role=\"bold\">C</emphasis> above, that any"
" files starting with a leading period are not shown. To display such "
"'hidden' files, the user must use the context menu available in area "
"<emphasis role=\"bold\">C</emphasis>."
msgstr ""
"Du kan ändra filtret i område <emphasis role=\"bold\">F</emphasis> genom att"
" klicka där, öppna rullgardinsmenyn och välja filtret ”Alla filer”. Det "
"filtret tillämpar inga regler, så filtreringen stängs i praktiken av och "
"alla filer i den valda mappen visas. Tänk ändå på att filer vars namn börjar"
" med en punkt inte visas, som varningen ovan i avsnittet om område <emphasis"
" role=\"bold\">C</emphasis> förklarar. Om du vill visa sådana dolda filer "
"öppnar du snabbmenyn i område <emphasis role=\"bold\">C</emphasis>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:445
msgid ""
"<emphasis role=\"bold\">G</emphasis> - The file format type selection area."
msgstr "<emphasis role=\"bold\">G</emphasis> – Området där filformat väljs."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:451 C/gnumeric.xml:291
msgid ""
"This area provides a drop down list of all the file formats provided by the "
"<application>Gnumeric</application> program itself and by all the currently "
"active plugins."
msgstr ""
"Här finns en rullgardinsmeny med alla filformat som tillhandahålls av "
"<application>Gnumeric</application> och de aktiva insticksmodulerna."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:456
msgid ""
"By default, <application>Gnumeric</application> is configured to "
"automatically recognize the type of each file selected by the user. This "
"recognition system is sophisticated and generally works. The best strategy "
"is to try opening the file using this automatic recognition strategy and, "
"only if the automatic recognition system fails, close the worksheet with the"
" mangled file and re-try to open the file a second time but manually "
"selecting the file type in the second attempt."
msgstr ""
"Som standard identifierar <application>Gnumeric</application> automatiskt "
"filtypen. Funktionen är avancerad och fungerar i regel. Prova först att "
"öppna filen med den automatiska identifieringen. Om den misslyckas stänger "
"du kalkylbladet med det felaktigt tolkade innehållet och försöker igen genom"
" att välja filtypen manuellt."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:467
msgid ""
"The file formats which can be selected are those listed in <xref "
"linkend=\"sect-file-open-formats\"/> below. Each of these formats are "
"explained in detail in <xref linkend=\"sect-file-formats\"/>."
msgstr ""
"Du kan välja filformaten som listas i <xref linkend=\"sect-file-open-"
"formats\"/> nedan. Varje format beskrivs närmare i <xref linkend=\"sect-"
"file-formats\"/>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:474 C/gnumeric.xml:815
msgid ""
"If the file format type named \"Text import (configurable)\" is opened, this"
" will start the text import procedure. <xref linkend=\"sect-file-"
"textImport\"/> explains this procedure in complete detail."
msgstr ""
"Om du väljer filformatet ”Textimport (konfigurerbar)” startar textimporten. "
"I <xref linkend=\"sect-file-textImport\"/> beskrivs den i detalj."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:487
msgid ""
"<emphasis role=\"bold\">H</emphasis> - The character encoding selection "
"area."
msgstr "<emphasis role=\"bold\">H</emphasis> – Området där teckenkodning väljs."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:493
msgid ""
"This area provides a drop down menu which allows the user to specify the "
"encoding which <application>Gnumeric</application> must use to interpret the"
" characters in text files. This menu is only enabled for the two text file "
"formats: \"Comma or Tab Separated Values (CSV/TSV)\" and \"Text Import "
"(configurable)\". This menu is disabled for all other file types because "
"<application>Gnumeric</application> automatically detects the encoding for "
"those files."
msgstr ""
"I det här området finns en rullgardinsmeny där du anger vilken kodning "
"<application>Gnumeric</application> ska använda för att tolka tecknen i "
"textfiler. Menyn är bara tillgänglig för de två textformaten: ”Komma- eller "
"tabbseparerade värden (CSV/TSV)” och ”Textimport (konfigurerbar)”. För andra"
" filtyper är menyn inaktiverad, eftersom <application>Gnumeric</application>"
" identifierar kodningen automatiskt."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:505
msgid ""
"A character encoding is a system to relate the binary digits contained in a "
"computer file to the characters of a textual script. All computer files "
"consist only of binary digits so some system is required to determine this "
"relationship. Where early computers used simple encoding systems which only "
"supported the characters commonly used in English, most systems are now "
"standardizing on the UTF-8 encoding scheme which relates the binary digits "
"in computer files to characters defined in the Universal Character Set, a "
"set which is still being defined but will include all the characters in "
"every language and many other useful symbols for mathematics, science, music"
" and literature. <xref linkend=\"sect-file-textImport-complex-encoding\"/> "
"contains a brief explanation of character encoding, and discusses the "
"encodings available in <application>Gnumeric</application>."
msgstr ""
"En teckenkodning kopplar de binära siffrorna i en datorfil till tecknen i "
"ett skriftsystem. Eftersom alla datorfiler bara består av binära siffror "
"behövs en kodning för att tolka dem. Tidiga datorer använde enkla kodningar "
"som bara stödde tecken som ofta används i engelska. I dag standardiserar de "
"flesta system på UTF-8, som kopplar filernas binära siffror till tecken i "
"den universella teckenuppsättningen. Den utvecklas fortfarande men ska "
"omfatta alla språks tecken och många andra användbara symboler för "
"matematik, naturvetenskap, musik och litteratur. <xref linkend=\"sect-file-"
"textImport-complex-encoding\"/> ger en kort förklaring av teckenkodning och "
"beskriver vilka kodningar som finns i <application>Gnumeric</application>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:527
msgid ""
"The character encoding can be set using the drop down menu in area <emphasis"
" role=\"bold\">H</emphasis>. By default, the encoding is set for the locale "
"of the user. The locale is set by the operating system and defines the "
"language, time zone and other geographic related preferences of the user. "
"The character encoding is changed by clicking on the drop down menu button "
"in area <emphasis role=\"bold\">H</emphasis>, that is by placing the mouse "
"pointer over this menu and clicking on the primary mouse button, and then "
"navigating the menu to select the new encoding, that is by moving the mouse "
"through the menus and clicking on the name of the new encoding. "
"<application>Gnumeric</application> will then use this encoding to open the "
"text file."
msgstr ""
"Du väljer teckenkodning i rullgardinsmenyn i område <emphasis "
"role=\"bold\">H</emphasis>. Som standard används kodningen för användarens "
"systemlokal. Operativsystemet styr lokalen, som anger språk, tidszon och "
"andra geografiska inställningar. Ändra kodningen genom att klicka på "
"menyknappen i område <emphasis role=\"bold\">H</emphasis> och sedan välja en"
" ny kodning i menyn. <application>Gnumeric</application> använder den när "
"textfilen öppnas."
